From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:35:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] network: Connection editor as a dialog with pages

Plinius: adding a VPN (and editing any connection) opened a window of its
own with notebook tabs (Details, Identity, IPv4, IPv6, Security/VPN) that
do not fit a 360 px wide phone. The editor is an AdwDialog now (a bottom
sheet on the phone, inside the Settings window) whose first page lists the
settings pages; a row opens its page as a navigation page with a back
button. Cancel and Apply stay on the first page. Closing the dialog any
other way still counts as cancel ("done" with FALSE once).
---
